data will be completely destroyed.

00:21:49.290 --> 00:21:50.990
What?

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:56.460
What will you do, Revolver?

00:22:05.690 --> 00:22:09.630
I was told repeatedly

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:17.110
Only tales of dreams

00:22:17.460 --> 00:22:24.080
Is my life precious?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:27.050
Make up for  Make up for

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:34.590
The next sentimental

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:45.840
I'm not a machine

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:52.280
I cry a single tear

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:57.480
A single answer moves me

00:22:58.670 --> 00:23:07.860
We helplessly sing for someone we can't reach

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:13.260
Are you ready?

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:18.640
Oh oh oh

00:23:19.160 --> 00:23:23.840
Are you ready?

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:30.950
Are you ready?

00:23:37.850 --> 00:23:45.240
Even with a hostage, the previous Revolver 
would've defeated his enemy without hesitation.

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:52.380
But after battling Playmaker and his 
friends, his heart is unsure for a moment.

00:23:52.380 --> 00:23:56.580
Lightning will not let this opportunity pass!

00:23:56.580 --> 00:23:59.920
